      "literal": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nM_1 \\vert 0\\rangle\n& =\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n  1 & 1\\\\\n  0 & 0\n\\end{pmatrix}\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n  1\\\\\n  0\n\\end{pmatrix}\n= \\begin{pmatrix}\n  1\\\\\n  0\n\\end{pmatrix}\n= \\vert 0\\rangle = \\vert f_1(0)\\rangle \\\\[4mm]\nM_1 \\vert 1\\rangle\n& =\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n  1 & 1\\\\\n  0 & 0\n\\end{pmatrix}\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n  0\\\\\n  1\n\\end{pmatrix}\n= \\begin{pmatrix}\n  1\\\\\n  0\n\\end{pmatrix}\n= \\vert 0\\rangle = \\vert f_1(1)\\rangle\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "status": "exact",
      "display": "1.  [\"M_1\"; 0] = [1; 0] = [1; 0] = [1; 0] = qstatecall(\"f_1\", 0)\n\n2.  [0; \"M_1\"] = [1; 0] = [1; 0] = [1; 0] = qstatecall(\"f_1\", 1)",
      "copy": "\\begin{gathered}qequalchain(vector(matrix(2,1,[\"M_1\",0]),matrix(2,1,[1,0]),matrix(2,1,[1,0]),matrix(2,1,[1,0]),qstatecall(\"f_1\",0)))\\\\qequalchain(vector(matrix(2,1,[0,\"M_1\"]),matrix(2,1,[1,0]),matrix(2,1,[1,0]),matrix(2,1,[1,0]),qstatecall(\"f_1\",1)))\\end{gathered}"
